{
  "_comment": "Replacements for speech synthesis only (scripts/gen-audio.mjs); the file key is computed from the original text. 'words': case-sensitive whole tokens (not inside a longer word; hyphens are boundaries, so 'IT' matches in 'IT-Abteilung'). 'patterns': JavaScript regular expressions (flag u), applied first. Spell-outs follow German letter names: A Ah, B Beh, C Zeh, D Deh, E Eh, F Eff, G Geh, H Hah, I Ih, J Jott, K Kah, L Ell, M Emm, N Enn, O Oh, P Peh, Q Kuh, R Ehr, S Ess, T Teh, U Uh, V Fau, W Weh, X Iks, Y Üpsilon, Z Zett.",
